  "system": {
    "identifier": "inuzuka-cross-guard",
    "description": "<p>You retaliate with sharpened claws, meant to punish would be assailants.</p>\n<p>Reduce the triggering damage by [Unarmed Damage] + [Unarmed Damage] (or [Unarmed Damage] + [Weapon Damage], if you have a weapon equipped.)</p>\n<p>If your Nin-Dog cast this, they reduce the triggering damage by an amount equal to their Bite + Bite.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage reduction by 1d6 for both you and your Nin-Dog.</p>",
